abstract: >-
  Open engineering-screening software, documentation, and illustrative data for
  diagnosing reaction, transport, diffusion, adsorption, separation, and
  process-intensification regimes in gas- and petroleum-stream desulfurization.
  The repository has E3 status as an engineering screening framework and
  executable research prototype. It is not a validated industrial design,
  emissions-compliance, or performance-guarantee model; real applications
  require system-specific data, uncertainty analysis, and independent validation.

